      "id": "claim_b5e0a98f7df44f93a5b97711fe32352c",
      "statement": "Before touching any host, the operator runs `tools/hx-doc/hx-preflight` from the repo root and expects `all clear`; a dead pin found here costs a minute but mid-build costs the morning, and a FAIL means fix the pin in `docs/03-runbooks/common/hx-base.env` before starting. hx-preflight checks downloads, PyPI, npm, Hugging Face and apt pins but cannot resolve an Ollama model tag.",
