      "id": "claim_4a61e18449e74a8384003418ab814f37",
      "statement": "Every server follows the same six-step shape: (1) 01-base-admin-network-updates.sh reboots; (2) 02-domain-nvidia.sh reboots; (3) 03-storage-ollama.sh, inference hosts only, skipped on HX-6..HX-17; (4) the application 10-<app>.sh block; (5) validate — starts, reboot, starts again; (6) record it. The two reboots are unavoidable.",
