      "id": "claim_f756d13e49b141119c6dbf3553bc3e22",
      "statement": "The dependency-driven build order is HX-4 first (shared embedding/reranker plane) through HX-8 Open WebUI last (consumer that proves one temporary conversation against an already-proven model and removes it), with HX-5 CentCom/Ornith second, HX-9 PostgreSQL and Redis, HX-10 Qdrant, HX-6 OmniRoute, HX-15 FastMCP, HX-5 DeepSeek Harness, HX-7 NGINX, HX-16 Docling, HX-17 Crawl4AI, HX-11 LightRAG, HX-13 Mem0, HX-12 Deep Agents, HX-14 n8n in between. Do not reorder without a reason.",
